OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786555124
OL,3,CDrought conditions exposes remains of
OL,4,Cvillage underneath Rutland Water
OL,6,FThe remains of a lost village that was
OL,7,Fdemolished and flooded to create
OL,8,FRutland Water reservoir have been
OL,9,Frevealed as the region and country
OL,10,Fcontinues to face drought conditions.
OL,12,FLow water levels at Rutland Water
OL,13,Freservoir in the East Midlands have
OL,14,Funcovered the remains of the buildings
OL,15,Fwhich were once part of the village of
OL,16,FNether Hambleton.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
