PN,34505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786555124
OL,3,CDrought conditions exposes remains of
OL,4,Cvillage underneath Rutland Water
OL,6,FAn amber warning for extreme heat has
OL,7,Fbeen issued by the Met Office for
OL,8,FThursday, as some parts of England
OL,9,Fface soaring temperatures of up to 38C.
OL,11,FThe forecaster has issued the warning
OL,12,Ffor London and parts of the South
OL,13,FEast, East Midlands, East of England,
OL,14,FWest Midlands and South Yorkshire from
OL,15,F9am to midnight on Thursday as
OL,16,Ftemperatures are to climb to 37C or
OL,17,F38C in some places.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786555124
OL,3,CDrought conditions exposes remains of
OL,4,Cvillage underneath Rutland Water
OL,6,FTony Grayling, the strategic drought
OL,7,Flead at the EA and chairman of the
OL,8,FNational Drought Group, said: "Drought
OL,9,Fconditions are worsening and will
OL,10,Fcontinue to do so until we see
OL,11,Fsignificant and sustained rainfall.
OL,13,F"We know the hot and dry weather is
OL,14,Ftaking a real toll on farming and
OL,15,Fthere will be long-lasting impacts on
OL,16,Four environment.
OL,26,@pD@_OUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1786555124
OL,3,CDrought conditions exposes remains of
OL,4,Cvillage underneath Rutland Water
OL,6,F"We want everyone to stay safe and
OL,7,Fhydrated over the summer, but we need
OL,8,Feveryone's help in using a little less
OL,9,Fwater to make sure our current water
OL,10,Freserves last.
OL,12,F"Every drop we can save is a drop more
OL,13,Ffor your local farmers, local wildlife
OL,14,Fand local rivers."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@RO]
